    "title": "Block Girls",
    "description": "Block Girls is a CREATIVE and addictive block puzzle Sudoku game. Immerse yourself in the Block story filled with pretty girls, making it a stress reliever like no other, to train your brain, to lighten your eyes with infinite fun! Unleash the excitement of Block as you unlock scenes and collect diverse beauties \u201ctoo hot to handle\u201c. Trust me, Block Girls really worth your time!\r\n\r\nWhat is the Goal?\r\nThe GOAL is to place kinds of blocks onto the 9x9 wooden board and fill rows, columns, or squares to clear blocks from the game. Play as long as you COULD without running out of space to beat your HIGHEST score and get the most rewards.\r\n- Play journey to unlock beauties that specifically designed for you\r\n- Exciting journey filled with romantic background, challenging level design and mysterious beauties revelations\r\n- Diverse beauties too hot to handle\r\n- Set beauty selfies as your game background, let her be your eternal companion\r\n\r\nHow to Play this Block Puzzle:\r\n- Drag different kind of block shapes onto the above board grid.\r\n- Try to fill a row, a column, or a square to clear blocks from the board.\r\n- Clear multiple rows or squares of blocks to get more rewards each time!\r\n- Clear wood blocks on every turn for a big win!\r\n- To be a block puzzle Sudoku master and romantic master.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- Romantic journey to make you great, keep smart, feel fantastic!\r\n- Easy to play! Just drag blocks onto the board\r\n- Magic companions. Start Block with sweetheart around you.\r\n- Phone/Tablet support\r\n\r\nBy playing Block Girls, you can give your brain a good enough training and get your body relaxed. Block Girls will offer you an easy time on your mobile phone or tablet! Get it FREE.\r\n\r\nBoys and girls, ladies and gentlemen, Strip off legacy Block Games! Join millions of game lovers, relax with this smash hit Block, and harvest fun and Rewards! PLAY NOW!",
